Roundtrip: a GGUF save+reload of the device model, compared against that model.
  Gated on NMSE(device, reloaded) <= 1e-04, NOT on bit-equality: this path is not
  bit-reproducible run to run, so OK does NOT mean the logits matched bit for bit.
  BITDIFF = bits differ, within tolerance. Magnitudes for any non-bit-exact row
  are on stderr.
